To the extent legally waivable, You have no entitlement to royalties, revenue share, license fees, payment, ownership percentages, or other compensation merely because the Licensor or its licensees use, relicense, or commercially exploit Your Contribution. This does not cancel compensation expressly agreed in writing or rights that applicable law makes non-waivable.

