No patent search, absolute guarantee of originality, or investigation beyond reasonable knowledge is required. If You discover a material rights problem, notify the Licensor promptly. Material You cannot license on these terms must be identified before submission and may be incorporated only under a separate arrangement preserving the relevant third-party rights.

To the extent lawful, You consent to modifications and exploitation authorized here and agree not to assert moral rights solely to prevent those authorized acts. This does not authorize false attribution or waive rights that cannot lawfully be waived.

The Licensor need not accept, maintain, support, or publicly release a Contribution. These grants survive withdrawal of a submission and termination of Your permissions, subject to mandatory law and the patent-specific provisions below. A separate contribution agreement expressly accepted by the Licensor controls any stated differences.

